  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">British International Investment (BII) Kinetic MEL</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Kinetic programme has a high risk tolerance and can be blended with other forms of capital. The portfolio enables BII to use catalytic capital in different ways to support partners &#x2013; ranging from funding to support them to close the &#x2018;viability gap&#x2019; on projects, to flexible debt products. This code covers the MEL aspect for all three facilities (Climate Innovation Facility, Mobilisation Facility and the Africa Resilience Investment Facility) within the Kinetic programme.</narrative>
  </description>
